The workflow's results
----------------------

The template carries each workflow step's result from its run on
2026-10-25 (results/<step id>.parquet): the hexagons' middles, each
middle's nearest facility and its distance, the people more than 5 km
away, and the people per district with their share. They are made from
all three sources together and carry each one's terms: the credits of the
two CC-BY-4.0 sources go with them.


